    "result_text": "AcceptanceTest is the only test class, and the full suite is green. \n\nThe implementation is complete. Here's a summary of the change:\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded an optional owner **`title`** (MR/MRS/MS/DR) and a derived read-only **`salutation`** field to the PetClinic REST app.\n\n**Salutation rule:** `title + \" \" + lastName` when a title is present, otherwise just `lastName`.\n\nChanges made, following the existing Spring/OpenAPI/MapStruct/JPA conventions:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`**\n   - Added `title` to the `OwnerFields` schema (string enum `MR`/`MRS`/`MS`/`DR`), so it's accepted on create and echoed back.\n   - Added read-only `salutation` to the `Owner` schema.\n\n2. **`model/Owner.java`**\n   - Added the persistent `title` column with getter/setter.\n   - Added a `@Transient getSalutation()` that composes the salutation per the rule.\n\n3. **Schema files** (`db/hsqldb`, `db/h2`, `db/mysql`, `db/postgres/schema.sql`)\n   - Added a `title` column to the `owners` table.\n\nThe generated DTOs (`OwnerFieldsDto`/`OwnerDto`) pick up both fields from the spec, and MapStruct auto-maps `title` (String \u21c4 enum) and `salutation` (from `getSalutation()`) with no extra mapper code needed.\n\n**Tests:** `AcceptanceTest` (the only test class, including the new `coreComposesSalutation` case) passes \u2014 `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`, `BUILD SUCCESS`.",
